Operator note:
Got a call from the site. INV-06 on Anatolia East Park tripped on String current low (A1520) since this morning. No visible damage from the camera. Weather clear.

Context:
{
  "plant": {
    "name": "Anatolia East Park",
    "capacity_mw": 2.8,
    "inverter_model": "SUN2000-215KTL"
  },
  "open_tickets": 4,
  "alarm_reference": {
    "code": "A1520",
    "name": "String current low",
    "severity": "warning"
  }
}

